		'Composer Action already prevents pointerdown default (f63), so blur-before-click is not a confirmed cause of this intermittent iOS report. The probe is opt-in via the tab menu and independent of webDiagnostics; all captured data stays in the page. It snapshots fixed target labels, focus, disabled state and geometry during the event, then observes defaultPrevented with a zero-delay timer: native dispatch can run microtasks between listeners, and Send may detach its target before the deferred observation.',
